.TH sam-jail-diagnose 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-diagnose \- Run the app once under strace to find missing resources
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail diagnose\fR [\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-\-apply\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the app once under strace to find missing resources
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<TIMEOUT>\fR [default: 30]

.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
Apply low\-risk fixes automatically
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

